# Workflow guidelines index (plugin-owned — replaced on update)

Trigger → file map for `.claude/guidelines/`. Skills read THIS file (not the guideline bodies) at plan / implement / scaffold time; a body is read only when its trigger matches the task in front of you.

The whole library is installed in every project, so this table is the same everywhere and is **copied verbatim, never generated**. A row whose subject this project has never touched is inert, not a mistake — it is there so that the day the project *does* grow a background job or a chart, `/plan` finds the guideline without anyone having to install it first.

Replaced wholesale on every `/workflow-update` — don't hand-edit. Project-specific triggers, and any deliberate deviation from a guideline, go in `.claude/memory/decisions.md`, which updates never touch.

| When the task involves… | Read |
|---|---|
| New app project, baseline requirements, logging/changelog/update mechanism, QA smoke-testing | `.claude/guidelines/app-baseline.md` |
| Logging, structured logs, observability, PII redaction | `.claude/guidelines/logging.md` |
| Backend/service architecture, layered app, use cases, repository pattern, external API client | `.claude/guidelines/service-architecture.md` |
| Scheduled tasks, cron, retries, background jobs, timers, graceful shutdown | `.claude/guidelines/background-jobs.md` |
| Web app / PWA, service worker, app version + update | `.claude/guidelines/web-app-pwa.md` |
| UI design, mockup, design system, icons, responsive layout, tooltips | `.claude/guidelines/ui-frontend.md` |
| Charts, graphs, plots, data viz, dashboards | `.claude/guidelines/plots-graphs.md` |
| Maps, tiles, markers/pins, clustering, offline maps, map tooltips | `.claude/guidelines/maps.md` |
| Changelog, release notes, in-app version history | `.claude/guidelines/changelog.md` |
| AI integration, Claude Agent SDK, AI features, LLM, transcripts, token budget | `.claude/guidelines/ai-integration.md` |
| Railway deploy, railway.json, deployment/hosting | `.claude/guidelines/railway.md` |
| Telegram bot, commands, inline keyboards, webhooks/polling | `.claude/guidelines/telegram-bots.md` |
